From: Marc-André Lureau <marcandre.lureau@redhat.com>

Add a .qapi_type pointer on all PropertyInfo definitions in
qdev-properties-system.c. Remove .enum_table from enum definitions,
since the lookup is now accessed through .qapi_type->lookup via the
qdev_propinfo_enum_lookup() fallback helper.

Update file-private enum accessor functions to use .qapi_type->lookup
instead of .enum_table.

Note, this should be a faithful conversion, but it would be worth to
consider better types than just "str" for references (block node names,
chardev/netdev IDs, MAC addrs, etc)

Signed-off-by: Marc-André Lureau <marcandre.lureau@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Markus Armbruster <armbru@redhat.com>
Message-ID: <20261101201717.3911097-49-armbru@redhat.com>
